        "guide1_icon": "<svg fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" width=\"29\" height=\"24\" class=\"icon icon--picto-fast-delivery   product-tabs__trust-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 29 24\">\n        <path d=\"M4 3H20V8M20 17H11.68C11.68 17 11 16 10 16M20 17V8M20 17H22.32M20 8H26.5L28 12.5V17H25.68C25.68 17 25 16 24 16M24 16C25 16 26 17 26 18C26 19 25 20 24 20C23 20 22 19 22 18C22 17.6527 22.1206 17.3054 22.32 17M24 16C23.3473 16 22.6946 16.426 22.32 17M10 16C11 16 12 17 12 18C12 19 11 20 10 20C9 20 8 19 8 18C8 17.6527 8.12061 17.3054 8.31996 17M10 16C9.3473 16 8.69459 16.426 8.31996 17M8.31996 17H4M10 12H3M10 8H1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n      </svg>",
        "guide1_returns_content": "<p><strong>Shipping<br/></strong>We deliver your parcel within 2–3 working days. As soon as your package has left our warehouse, you will receive a confirmation by email. This confirmation contains a tracking number that you can use to find out where your package is.</p><p><strong>Return Policy</strong><br/><br/>We offer a <strong>7-day replacement policy</strong> for products that arrive with physical damage only. If you receive a damaged item, please report it within <strong>7 days of delivery</strong>.<br/><br/>To request a replacement, please contact our support team with clear photos of the damaged product and packaging. Once the issue is verified, we will arrange for a <strong>replacement of the same item</strong>.<br/><br/>Please note:<br/><em>This policy applies only to products with physical damage during transit.<br/>Returns or refunds are not available. Only </em><em><strong>replacement </strong></em><em>will be provided for eligible cases.</em></p>",
